    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Window-based gameplay Drag and drop the window to see the world.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373000/extras/d57628bf1ac229260371fb8f883c8d9d.avif?t=1739521336\" width=786 height=622 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open multiple windows for interaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373000/extras/6f86364fc6a387d7e0832bc4886230b8.avif?t=1739521336\" data-has-big width=800 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world may be different in each window.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373000/extras/1df11f90388cb21687aca073931732b1.avif?t=1739521336\" data-has-big width=800 height=466 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters can travel through windows to other windowed worlds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373000/extras/eb892f61095fff2b8d55a28947b44ed0.avif?t=1739521336\" data-has-big width=800 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or maybe, explore a completely different world? (Temporarily using free assets)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373000/extras/3e41539209be56fc459d52ad4cee9e51.poster.avif?t=1739521336\" width=800 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373000/extras/3e41539209be56fc459d52ad4cee9e51.webm?t=1739521336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373000/extras/3e41539209be56fc459d52ad4cee9e51.mp4?t=1739521336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game was created using Unity (which has no built-in new window functionality) and uses an incredible amount of technology just to deliver an absolutely unique gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add it to your wish list now instantly, the demo version will be available soon.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Window-based gameplay Drag and drop the window to see the world.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373000/extras/d57628bf1ac229260371fb8f883c8d9d.avif?t=1739521336\" width=786 height=622 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open multiple windows for interaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373000/extras/6f86364fc6a387d7e0832bc4886230b8.avif?t=1739521336\" data-has-big width=800 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world may be different in each window.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373000/extras/1df11f90388cb21687aca073931732b1.avif?t=1739521336\" data-has-big width=800 height=466 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters can travel through windows to other windowed worlds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373000/extras/eb892f61095fff2b8d55a28947b44ed0.avif?t=1739521336\" data-has-big width=800 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or maybe, explore a completely different world? (Temporarily using free assets)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373000/extras/3e41539209be56fc459d52ad4cee9e51.poster.avif?t=1739521336\" width=800 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373000/extras/3e41539209be56fc459d52ad4cee9e51.webm?t=1739521336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373000/extras/3e41539209be56fc459d52ad4cee9e51.mp4?t=1739521336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game was created using Unity (which has no built-in new window functionality) and uses an incredible amount of technology just to deliver an absolutely unique gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add it to your wish list now instantly, the demo version will be available soon.</p>",
